{"seq":3,"slug":"customizing-animations","title":"自定义过渡动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-view-transitions/same-document/customizing-animations","wordCount":1071,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"自定义过渡动画\">自定义过渡动画</h1><p>浏览器默认给你一段 0.25 秒的交叉淡入淡出。它够用，但绝不够「品牌化」——同一套 API，配上不同的缓动、方向、时长，可以是 iOS 风格的横向滑入、可以是 Material 风格的容器升降、也可以是后退时的逆向回退。自定义动画的全部抓手，就是用 CSS 覆盖那棵临时伪元素树上的 UA 默认样式。这一篇讲清「改什么、改在哪一层、怎么根据前进后退区分方向」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自定义动画的本质，是用 CSS 覆盖浏览器注入伪元素树的那套 UA 默认样式。本篇围绕「改什么、改在哪层、怎么分方向」展开——改时长这类轻量覆盖、用关键帧自定义进入/离开动画、用过渡类型 <code>types</code> 配合 <code>:active-view-transition-type()</code> 实现前进后退的方向区分、用 <code>:active-view-transition</code> 施加过渡期临时样式，最后回到无障碍底线。几何改 group 层、像素改 old/new 层，是贯穿全篇的分工总纲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖默认值-从改时长开始\">覆盖默认值：从改时长开始</h2><p>最轻的自定义是改时长。默认动画挂在 <code>::view-transition-group(*)</code>、<code>::view-transition-old(*)</code>、<code>::view-transition-new(*)</code> 上，你只要在同名选择器上重写对应属性即可：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"::view-transition-group(*),&#10;::view-transition-old(*),&#10;::view-transition-new(*) {&#10;  animation-duration: 0.45s;&#10;  animation-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::view-transition-group(</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::view-transition-old(</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::view-transition-new(</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.45</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-timing-function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cubic-bezier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>回顾<a href=\"../foundations/pseudo-element-tree\">过渡伪元素树</a>的分工心法：几何变形在 group 层、像素进出在 old/new 层。改时长往往三层一起改才协调，但改进出动画就只动 old/new。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自定义进入与离开关键帧\">自定义进入与离开关键帧</h2><p>整页或某元素的「离开」动画写在 <code>::view-transition-old()</code>，「进入」写在 <code>::view-transition-new()</code>。例如把默认淡入淡出换成上下滑动：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"@keyframes slide-from-right {&#10;  from {&#10;    transform: translateX(30px);&#10;    opacity: 0;&#10;  }&#10;  to {&#10;    transform: translateX(0);&#10;    opacity: 1;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;@keyframes slide-to-left {&#10;  from {&#10;    transform: translateX(0);&#10;    opacity: 1;&#10;  }&#10;  to {&#10;    transform: translateX(-30px);&#10;    opacity: 0;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;::view-transition-old(root) {&#10;  animation: 0.3s ease both slide-to-left;&#10;}&#10;::view-transition-new(root) {&#10;  animation: 0.3s ease both slide-from-right;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> slide-from-right</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translateX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translateX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> slide-to-left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translateX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translateX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::view-transition-old(root) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> both</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slide-to-left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::view-transition-new(root) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> both</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slide-from-right;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里 <code>both</code> 很关键——它让动画在开始前和结束后都保持关键帧状态，避免末尾闪一下回默认。注意：old/new 上的 <code>transform</code> 是叠加在快照图像上的，与 group 层的几何插值不冲突，二者会合成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过渡类型-types-一套-dom-多种方向\">过渡类型（types）：一套 DOM，多种方向</h2><p>最实用的高级能力，是让同一段 DOM 更新根据「这次是前进还是后退」呈现不同方向的动画。<code>startViewTransition</code> 支持传入类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"document.startViewTransition({&#10;  update: updateDOM,&#10;  types: [&#39;forward&#39;], // 或 [&#39;back&#39;]&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>document.startViewTransition({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  update: updateDOM,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  types: ['forward'], // 或 ['back']</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>类型会作为 <code>:active-view-transition-type()</code> 暴露给 CSS，让你写出方向相关的动画：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\":active-view-transition-type(forward) {&#10;  &amp;::view-transition-old(root) {&#10;    animation: 0.3s ease both slide-to-left;&#10;  }&#10;  &amp;::view-transition-new(root) {&#10;    animation: 0.3s ease both slide-from-right;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;:active-view-transition-type(back) {&#10;  &amp;::view-transition-old(root) {&#10;    animation: 0.3s ease both slide-to-right;&#10;  }&#10;  &amp;::view-transition-new(root) {&#10;    animation: 0.3s ease both slide-from-left;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:active-view-transition-type(forward) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x26;::view-transition-old(root) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> both</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slide-to-left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x26;::view-transition-new(root) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> both</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slide-from-right;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:active-view-transition-type(back) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x26;::view-transition-old(root) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> both</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slide-to-right;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x26;::view-transition-new(root) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> both</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slide-from-left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这一招把「前进右进、后退左回」这类符合用户空间直觉的导航动效，用纯声明式 CSS 表达出来，无需为每个方向写不同的 JS 分支。</p>\n<h2 id=\"active-view-transition-过渡期间的临时样式\">:active-view-transition：过渡期间的临时样式</h2><p><code>:active-view-transition</code> 是一个文档级选择器，仅在过渡进行时匹配 <code>&lt;html&gt;</code>。它用于施加「只在过渡期间生效」的样式，例如临时禁用某些昂贵的视觉效果、或给页面加一层遮罩：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\":active-view-transition {&#10;  /* 过渡期间隐藏会干扰快照的浮动元素 */&#10;  .floating-toast {&#10;    visibility: hidden;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">active-view-transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 过渡期间隐藏会干扰快照的浮动元素 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">floating-toast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    visibility</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hidden</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>它与 <code>:active-view-transition-type()</code> 的区别：前者只问「现在是否在过渡」，后者还问「是哪种类型的过渡」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"各层可改属性速查\">各层可改属性速查</h2><p>下表把「想要的效果 → 改哪层 → 改什么属性」一次列清：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>想要的效果</th>\n<th>操作层</th>\n<th>关键属性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整体变快/变慢</td>\n<td>group + old + new</td>\n<td><code>animation-duration</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换缓动曲线</td>\n<td>group（几何）/ old·new（进出）</td>\n<td><code>animation-timing-function</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义离开动画</td>\n<td><code>::view-transition-old()</code></td>\n<td><code>animation</code>（含 <code>@keyframes</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义进入动画</td>\n<td><code>::view-transition-new()</code></td>\n<td><code>animation</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前进/后退不同方向</td>\n<td><code>:active-view-transition-type()</code></td>\n<td>配合方向关键帧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调整变形元素层级</td>\n<td><code>::view-transition-group()</code></td>\n<td><code>z-index</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过渡期临时样式</td>\n<td><code>:active-view-transition</code></td>\n<td>任意</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自定义流程一图\">自定义流程一图</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[确定要改的是几何还是像素] --&gt; B{几何变形?&lt;br/&gt;位置/尺寸/层级}&#10;  B -- 是 --&gt; C[改 ::view-transition-group&lt;br/&gt;duration / timing / z-index]&#10;  B -- 否 --&gt; D{改进出动画?}&#10;  D -- 离开 --&gt; E[写 ::view-transition-old 关键帧]&#10;  D -- 进入 --&gt; F[写 ::view-transition-new 关键帧]&#10;  C --&gt; G{需区分前进后退?}&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G -- 是 --&gt; H[传 types + :active-view-transition-type]&#10;  G -- 否 --&gt; I[完成]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[确定要改的是几何还是像素] --&gt; B{几何变形?&lt;br/&gt;位置/尺寸/层级}\n  B -- 是 --&gt; C[改 ::view-transition-group&lt;br/&gt;duration / timing / z-index]\n  B -- 否 --&gt; D{改进出动画?}\n  D -- 离开 --&gt; E[写 ::view-transition-old 关键帧]\n  D -- 进入 --&gt; F[写 ::view-transition-new 关键帧]\n  C --&gt; G{需区分前进后退?}\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G -- 是 --&gt; H[传 types + :active-view-transition-type]\n  G -- 否 --&gt; I[完成]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"别忘了无障碍\">别忘了无障碍</h2><p>自定义动画越花哨，越要尊重 <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>。对前庭敏感用户，大幅度的滑动与缩放可能引发不适。正确做法是在媒体查询里把动画时长压到极短或直接 <code>skipTransition</code>，详见<a href=\"../practice/view-transition-fallback\">降级与渐进增强</a>。动效设计的「有意义、自然、可关闭」原则在 <a href=\"../../web-animation/design-and-advanced/orchestration-and-accessibility\">web-animation（22）的可访问性编排</a> 有系统论述，视图过渡的自定义同样适用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自定义动画的本质是用 CSS 覆盖伪元素树上的 UA 默认样式：几何改 group 层，进出改 old/new 层。</li>\n<li><code>both</code> 填充模式避免动画首尾闪回默认；old/new 的 transform 与 group 几何插值会合成。</li>\n<li>过渡类型 <code>types</code> + <code>:active-view-transition-type()</code> 用纯声明式 CSS 实现前进/后退方向区分。</li>\n<li><code>:active-view-transition</code> 施加只在过渡期间生效的临时样式。</li>\n<li>自定义越强，越须用 <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code> 守住无障碍底线。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>要改的伪元素层级结构是什么：<a href=\"../foundations/pseudo-element-tree\">过渡伪元素树</a></li>\n<li>无障碍降级的具体写法：<a href=\"../practice/view-transition-fallback\">降级与渐进增强</a></li>\n<li>跨库：动效编排与可访问性原则——<a href=\"../../web-animation/design-and-advanced/orchestration-and-accessibility\">web-animation（22）编排与可访问性</a></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>特性参考：<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/View_Transition_API/Using\">MDN: Using the View Transition API</a>、<a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-view-transitions-2/\">CSS View Transitions Module Level 2 草案</a>（2026 年访问）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自定义过渡动画","id":"自定义过渡动画"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖默认值：从改时长开始","id":"覆盖默认值-从改时长开始"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义进入与离开关键帧","id":"自定义进入与离开关键帧"},{"level":2,"text":"过渡类型（types）：一套 DOM，多种方向","id":"过渡类型-types-一套-dom-多种方向"},{"level":2,"text":":active-view-transition：过渡期间的临时样式","id":"active-view-transition-过渡期间的临时样式"},{"level":2,"text":"各层可改属性速查","id":"各层可改属性速查"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义流程一图","id":"自定义流程一图"},{"level":2,"text":"别忘了无障碍","id":"别忘了无障碍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"命名过渡与共享元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-view-transitions/same-document/named-transitions"},"next":{"title":"跨文档 MPA 过渡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-view-transitions/cross-document/mpa-transitions"}}